          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sonolência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;I’m also on 80mg of beta blockers to try and stop the migraines AND 40mg of citalopram for my wonky brain so I think everything just works together and makes me sleep&quot;}" />
