          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertraline&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Fluoxetine&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Mirtazapina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;They reckon we're in for a warm spell of weather so it's probably a good time to remind those of Depression medications Sertaline/Citalopram/Fluoxetine/Mirtazipine or any other SRRI 💊 to keep their fluids up\n\nTo stop you from becoming dehydrated or overheating\n\nIt could save a life&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Sertraline&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Parece ser que la sertralina me está provocando este calor que tengo siempre y una regulación de la temperatura dudosa\nLiteralmente todo el mundo con chaqueta, pantalones largos etc y yo con manga corta y pantalón corto y asade 🥹🥹&quot;}" />
