      <node id="Lamotrigine" label="Lamotrigine">
        <attvalues>
          <attvalue for="0" value="medication" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="1" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Somnolência&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Always so interesting to hear how people have such different reactions to different medications! I started on citalopram for depression, then the lamotrigine came in after my bp diagnosis. kind of made me feel like a zombie though, I’m not sure why. just hazy and like I wasn’t really there&quot;}" />
