          <attvalue for="0" value="adr" />
          <attvalue for="1" value="4" />
          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Ketamine&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;And if that’s not clear\n\nI mean\n\nThey are all \n\nShooting ketamine\nTaking Citalopram\nDrinking Ethanol \nSnorting Blue Flake Cocaine \n\nTo Stay Dedicated to The Mission\n\nThey are administrative berserkers\n\nWe Need Standard Drug Testing For Any Security Clearance \n\nIf for any reason, just to know&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Citalopram dreams have been a bit weird.\n\nI dreamt last night that I confronted Elon Musk about the state of Twitter and its moderation. He responded to me exactly how I’d expect him to with memeful rhetoric then for some weird reason he just disappeared out of thin air.\n\nWtf brain.&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Zolpidem&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;amg, zolpidem é mto forte 🥺 minha mãe toma ele e fica delirando e 2x que eu tomei, fiquei do mesmo jeito. \nagr eu tomo trazodona&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Venlafaxine&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;é horripilante demais, os efeitos adversos da venlafaxina acabaram comigo durante umas duas semanas, fiquei tendo delírio quase \n\nfoda demais (mas resolveu o remédio pra mim)&quot;}" />
          <attvalue for="3" value="4" />
