          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;like I'm walking down the street to go and do my shopping, feeling fine, and all I can think about is blowing my brains out. But it's like, just an image, not really connected to an emotion (I think pre-citalopram these images would have been connected to more of a feeling? I can't remember)&quot;}" />
