          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Phelps: “I had one PhD psychologist patient who took nearly a year to get from 20 mg of citalopram to 5 mg. At 3 mg using a liquid form, she said, “just put me in the hospital and stop it.” She knew she’d be having suicidal thoughts.”&quot;}" />
