          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;What idiot took their high dose citalopram before work today, I’ll give you three guesses. It’s not a vibe. The vibes are off somewhere probably in bed.&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Citalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Which ones, if you don't mind me asking? Citalopram gave me goldfish memory for a year, until I switched to Sertraline which just gave me occasionally vertigo instead.&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;think I just got fucked up by just a different brand of my usual med? But I switch up brands all the time and this doesn’t happen? I just took my escitalopram and experienced something that felt v much like hardcore venlafaxine withdrawal??Has this happened to anyone? I know u r all on escitalopram&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;think I just got fucked up by just a different brand of my usual med? But I switch up brands all the time and this doesn’t happen? I just took my escitalopram and experienced something that felt v much like hardcore venlafaxine withdrawal??Has this happened to anyone? I know u r all on escitalopram&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Paroxetin&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Eu fiz tratamento com ela durante anos, na época me ajudou muito, mas os efeitos colaterais são péssimos mesmo, agora eu troquei pelo paroxetina&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Bupropion&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;o tanto de efeito colateral do bupropiona eu vou é continuar fumando&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Trazodone&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Eu te amo, mas a trazodona me tira o controle do inconsciente 🤷🏻‍♂️&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Venlafaxina&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;essa noite dormi melhor que a minha sobrinha de um mês mas em compensação atrasei 30 minutos a venlafaxina o que já foi o suficiente pro cérebro descolar do crânio pqp&quot;}" />
