          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;Hey, question for those who are long-time users of escitalopram?\n\nDo you have uncontrollable limb movements, jaw clenching or vocalizations?  I've read about Tardive Dyskinesia, but Lexapro isn't one of the medications listed as a possible cause.\n\nSo I'm wondering what's going on here.&quot;}" />
