          <attvalue for="2" value="{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Escitalopram&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;During the day, my head os rarely quiet. When I started Escitalopram a year ago, the immediate side effect was *silence*.\nThen my brain adjusted &amp; now there's noise again, though not as bad as before.\nMaybe that noise is why my dreams are so... so overwhelming? My mind never rests..?&quot;}|||{&quot;category&quot;: &quot;Venlafaxine&quot;, &quot;content&quot;: &quot;o desmame de venlafaxina é uma das piores coisas que existem nesse mundo, puta que pariu\n\ntô morta de cansada mas não consigo dormir direito pq tô tendo sonhos estranhos&quot;}" />
